# omni-mcp — Project Context

Local MCP proxy gateway (TypeScript/Node) plus a management UI. No login.

| Piece | Details |
|-------|---------|
| Gateway | `src/` — HTTP on port `6317` (`/mcp` MCP, `/api` JSON, `/` UI) |
| CLI | `src/cli/` — `omni-mcp start`, `status`, `add`, `reload`, … |
| Web UI | `web/` — Vite + React + shadcn, built into `dist/ui` |

Default bind is `127.0.0.1`. Mutating `/api` routes require a loopback client. Binding `0.0.0.0` without auth is unsafe.

Specs live in `docs/specs/`. Check the relevant spec before changing behavior.
